You fold the space between yourself and a second point within a range of 10, creating a pair of wormholes.  Any creature stepping on either wormhole will be teleported near the other (radius [5, 3, 3, 2, 2 (TL1-5; PARADOX 300)] accuracy).

The wormholes will last [6, 7, 8, 9, 10 (TL1-5; PARADOX 300)] turns and must be placed at least two tiles apart.

The chance of teleporting enemies will scale with your Spellpower.
